Pre-existing (unrelated to NEARS-2545 diff) uncaught FirebaseException on iOS cold start,
both PATCHED and UNPATCHED builds. Root cause: FirebaseMessaging.instance.subscribeToTopic()
calls in auth_repository.dart / location_service.dart (untouched by this ticket's diff) hit
_APNSTokenCheck() before an APNS token is available on this simulator, throwing an
uncaught async FirebaseException surfaced via the app's own Crashlytics-block + AppLogger
UncaughtAsyncError catch-all (NOT a silent swallow -- already logged via [FAIL]).
